**Overview:**

Northern Railways Ltd. operates an extensive freight network across the Midwest region, focusing on efficient transportation of goods via our railway system. Our latest scheduling system, RailTrack 2.0, has improved our on-time delivery rate to 93%, up from 88% last quarter. This report outlines our current station capacities, freight schedules, and partnerships with key logistics companies.

